    "detailed_description": "Sync Adventure is a simple indie platform game. In the game, you control Slime across the platforms, go to space, and defeat the boss. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is one-button designed, you can pause, resume, restart, quit the game, move, jump, drive a spaceship, shoot cannons, and defeat a boss all by just pressing one button. With different pressing time, you can control Slime as you wish.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBy counting the death and the time reaching certain levels. The difficulty will automatically adjust.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout the estimated gaming time, it is expected to be within one hour or maybe even shorter for the first try.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n- One-button designed<br />\r\n- Adaptive difficulty system<br />\r\n- 3 difficult star-collecting challenges<br />\r\n- Inappropriate music and sound effects<br />\r\n- Simple graphics",
